<title>LEBANON: Quake hits Lebanon.</title>
<headline>Quake hits Lebanon.</headline>
<dateline>BEIRUT 1997-03-26</dateline>
<text>
<p>An earthquake shook Lebanon on Wednesday but there was no immediate news of casualties or damage, residents said.</p>
<p>It was not immediately known what the quake, which was felt across the country a little before 6:30 am local time (0430 gmt), measured on the Richter scale.</p>
